# Bolt Bend (ruling 2024-11-08): "If a spell or ability targets multiple things, you can't target it with Bolt Bend, even if
# all but one of those targets have become illegal." Bot1's Kolaghan's Command destroys Bot2's Ornithopter and deals 2
# damage to Bot2. In response Bot2's Blossoming Defense gives the Ornithopter hexproof: its target is now illegal, the
# player target is the only legal one left, yet Bolt Bend (all four of its other Moxen untapped) is refused. The Command
# resolves for the player alone: Bot2 at 18, and the Ornithopter survives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Kolaghan's Command
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Blossoming Defense
Bolt Bend
Island x12

